{"id": "965_gasstation_10_shop_entrance|gasstation-01-shop-intro|T6", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You walk into the mini-mart.", "passage": "gasstation-01-shop-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Entras al minimercado.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_10_shop_entrance|gasstation-01-shop-clerkA|T11", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The clerk behind the counter is undoubtedly the most ordinary person you’ve ever seen.", "passage": "gasstation-01-shop-clerkA", "source": "textasset", "es": "El empleado detrás del mostrador es, sin duda, la persona más común que has visto en tu vida.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_10_shop_entrance|gasstation-01-shop-clerkB|T16", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Behind the counter, a student doing his homework lazily raises his head.", "passage": "gasstation-01-shop-clerkB", "source": "textasset", "es": "Detrás del mostrador, un estudiante que hace la tarea levanta la cabeza con desgano.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_10_shop_entrance|gasstation-01-shop-clerkC|T21", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The guy behind the counter looks like all the other guys behind counters you’ve come across in your lifetime.", "passage": "gasstation-01-shop-clerkC", "source": "textasset", "es": "El tipo detrás del mostrador se parece a todos los demás tipos detrás de mostradores que has conocido en tu vida.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_10_shop_entrance|gasstation-01-shop-clerkD|T26", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "There’s a smell coming off the guy running the shop at this station…", "passage": "gasstation-01-shop-clerkD", "source": "textasset", "es": "Hay un olor que desprende el tipo que atiende la tienda de esta gasolinera…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
